# Try the API from inside VS Code.
#
# 1. Install the "REST Client" extension (by Huachao Mao).
# 2. Start the server: npm run dev
# 3. Click "Send Request" above any request below.
#
# Run them top to bottom the first time: "Log in" saves your token and
# "Create a task" saves the task id, so the requests after them work automatically.
# Note: register/login are limited to 10 requests per 15 minutes.

@baseUrl = http://localhost:3000/api/v1

### API overview
GET {{baseUrl}}

### Health check
GET {{baseUrl}}/health

### Register a new account (change the email if it's already taken)
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Ada Lovelace",
  "email": "ada@example.com",
  "password": "Password123"
}

### Log in (saves the token for the requests below)
# @name login
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "ada@example.com",
  "password": "Password123"
}

@token = {{login.response.body.data.token}}

### Who am I?
GET {{baseUrl}}/auth/me
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Create a task (saves its id for the requests below)
# @name createTask
POST {{baseUrl}}/tasks
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Write the project README",
  "description": "Cover setup, endpoints and examples",
  "priority": "high",
  "dueDate": "2026-12-31T17:00:00+08:00"
}

@taskId = {{createTask.response.body.data.id}}

### List my tasks
GET {{baseUrl}}/tasks
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### List with filters, search and sorting
GET {{baseUrl}}/tasks?status=todo&priority=high&search=readme&sortBy=dueDate&order=asc&page=1&limit=5
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Get one task
GET {{baseUrl}}/tasks/{{taskId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Update some fields (PATCH)
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/tasks/{{taskId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "status": "in_progress"
}

### Replace the whole task (PUT): fields you leave out go back to their defaults
PUT {{baseUrl}}/tasks/{{taskId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Write and publish the README",
  "status": "done",
  "priority": "medium"
}

### Delete the task
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/tasks/{{taskId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### --- Error examples ---

### Validation error (empty title, bad status)
POST {{baseUrl}}/tasks
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "",
  "status": "finished"
}

### No token
GET {{baseUrl}}/tasks

### Malformed task id
GET {{baseUrl}}/tasks/not-a-uuid
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
